                <div align="center" class="heading"><b>Contest Bazaar Season 1</b></div>
                <p style="font-size: 15px"><b>Part –A: Campaign Terms and Conditions (“T&C”)</b></p>
                <p>A&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Campaign Period – From   1st November, 2020 12:00:00 hours to 31st December, 2020 23:59:59 hours.</p>
                <p>B&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;For the avoidance of any doubt, please note that the gratifications offered under this Campaign are solely sponsored and distributed by Contest Bazaar for the Winner(s) (defined later) of this Campaign to be participated by the user.</p>
                <p>C&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A User (participating in this Campaign shall be referred to as “Participant/Participant(s)/Participants”) by participating in the Campaign, hereby agrees to the T&C mentioned below and gives his/her irrevocable consent to the process of selecting the winner as set out herein, and any appropriate changes that may be made to this Campaign by Contest Bazaar, including due to any legal or regulatory requirement, instructions from any judicial or a quasi-judicial body or due to any natural calamity beyond the reasonable control of Contest Bazaar, its affiliates and associates or for any other reason whatsoever.</p>
                <p>D&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;For the purposes of these T&C, wherever the context so requires “You” or “Your” shall mean any natural person who is a Participant. These T&C are available on the website <a href="http://contestbazaar.mobi/contest/tandc.aspx" class="a">http://contestbazaar.mobi/contest/tnc</a></p>
                <p>E&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The T&C can be amended or varied from time to time or withdrawn and therefore, please visit the Website periodically to keep yourself updated and informed.</p>
                <p>F&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;By participating in the Campaign, You indicate your acknowledgement and acceptance of these T&C.</p>
                <p>G&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The cash back is being extended by Sanvir Digitech Private Limited.</p>
                <p><b>1&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>Unconditional Approval/Acceptance:</b></u></p>
                <p>1.1&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Participant is aware that answers submitted on the WAP portal and sent by the Participant may not be received by Contest Bazaar instantly due to various factors outside the control of Contest Bazaar such as Network failure, system failure etc.</p>
                <p>1.2&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The time at which the Participant(s) answered through click on WAP portal from his/her handset will not be considered even if it is earlier. (Example – Participant sent answer at 14:00hrs but it was received by Contest Bazaar at 15:00hrs. then under such scenario Contest Bazaar will consider the time as 15:00hrs only).</p>
                <p>1.3&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Participant(s) undertakes not to dispute/challenge the delay caused in receiving the answer through WAP by Contest Bazaar due to network failure, system failure, etc., which are beyond the control of Contest Bazaar.</p>
                <p>1.4&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The winner (“Winner”) must have a valid KYC verified account. If the account is not KYC verified, the Winner must submit documents for KYC and get his/her account KYC verified. The list of the Winner(s) of the gratification will be published on the Website <a href="http://contestbazaar.mobi/contest/DeclareWinner.aspx" class="a">http://contestbazaar.mobi/contest/winner</a></p>
                <p>1.5&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;He/she must be registered User through which they attempted to play the Campaign and chosen as the Winner(s) under this Campaign. The Participant(s) must have a registered account on his/her own name through which they are buying packs/questions.</p>
                <p><b>2&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>Charging:</b></u></p>
                <p>To participate in/register for the Campaign, the Participant(s) have to:</p>
                <p>2.1&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Buy question packs available on the Contest Bazaar portal to play the Campaign by following the below mentioned steps:</p>
                <p>a)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Click/Type Contest Bazaar (URL) on his/her mobile phone/laptop/desktop.</p>
                <p>b)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;After Clicking on the Quiz URL, Participant(s) will be redirected to the home page where He/she will have to enter the mobile number & email id for registration & click on the lest play button.</p>
                <p>c)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;After Clicking on the play button, Participant(s) will be redirected to store page for purchase of pack to answer questions (pack options are mentioned below).</p>
                <p>d)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;After successful selection of pack, Participant(s) will be redirected to paytm website for payment of questions, he/she has to Login with Paytm account credentials for successful payment.</p>
                <p>e)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;After successful purchase, he/she will be redirected to question page and shall be able to answer the questions.</p>
                <p>2.2&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;To continue further with the Campaign, the Participant(s) have an option to buy more packs to score more. They can purchase more packs Participant(s) would get “pack options” to select from and post giving consent & paying from Paytm, Participant(s) shall be charged. Below are the various pack options for the Participant(s):</p>
                <div align="center">
                    <u>Pack Price</u>
                    <br />
                    <table border="1" align="center" style="align-content: center">
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center"><b>Price (INR)</b></td>
                            <td align="center"><b>No. of Questions in a pack</b></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">1,500</td>
                            <td align="center">500</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">1,050</td>
                            <td align="center">300</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">600</td>
                            <td align="center">150</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">225</td>
                            <td align="center">50</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">99</td>
                            <td align="center">99  (First time user only)</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">25</td>
                            <td align="center">5</td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <p>2.3&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Only for first (1st) time Participant(s) of the Contest Bazaar Campaign Season can buy a special pack for Rs.99 (Rupees Nineteen nine) where Participant(s) will get Ninety nine (99) questions. This pack is available only once per Participant(s) upon first (1st) purchase only.</p>
                <div align="center">
                    <table border="1" align="center" style="align-content: center">
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center"><b>Pack Price (INR)</b></td>
                            <td align="center"><b>No. of Questions in a pack</b></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">99</td>
                            <td align="center">99</td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <p>2.4&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The charged amount will not be refunded to Participant(s) under any circumstances.</p>
                <p>2.5&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Participant(s) will be granted questions according to the question pack as pasted above. The pack/question is available till the tenure of the Campaign Period. If there would be question which is left to be played and Campaign Period expires then the unplayed question will be forfeited by Contest Bazaar and unplayed question and points which he/she has earned shall not carry forward to any other campaign organized by Contest Bazaar in future.</p>
                <p>2.6&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Participant(s) shall be asked skill/knowledge based questions during the Campaign Period.</p>
                <p>2.7&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Participant(s) must be active during the Campaign Period and will be informed by Contest Bazaar from time to time about their engagement towards Campaign through WAP or SMS Channels.</p>
                <p>2.8&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If a Participant(s) gets more questions than what s/he purchased, due to any type of error/glitch, Contest Bazaar will select Winners only on the basis of the number of purchased questions answered correctly. The additional questions will be scrapped.</p>

                <p><b>3&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>Point System:</u></b></p>
                <p>3.1&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;For every right answer , Participant(s) will get 10 Points.</p>
                <p>3.2&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;There will be no negative marking under this Campaign, whereas negative marking can come in effect on sole discretion of Contest Bazaar at any time during the Campaign.</p>
                <p><b>4&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>Pack Limit:</u></b></p>
                <p>4.1&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Participant(s) can buy as many packs as required. The number of questions that a participant can play would depend upon the kind of pack(s) purchased. The questions may get repeated in different packs.</p>
                <p><b>5&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>Winner Selection Criteria:</u></b></p>
                <p>5.1&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bumper & Daily prize: Bumper & Daily Prize Winner(s) selection shall be done based on the following criteria in order of priority as mentioned below:</p>
                <p>a)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Highest Score</p>
                <p>b)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Minimum attempts</p>
                <p>c)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The total score of a participant will be calculated by the points scored</p>
                <p>d)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;In case there is a tie between Participant(s) on above mentioned criteria, Contest Bazaar reserves the right to make the Participant(s) who have tied play 5 additional questions, and the Participant whosoever scores highest in minimum attempts, shall be selected as a Winner of this campaign at discretion of Contest Bazaar, and if in case a Winner is yet not selected, this process shall continue till a single undisputed Winner is selected. Further, the Winner will not challenge or dispute any decision(s) taken by Contest Bazaar for choosing a Winner.</p>
                <p>e)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Participant(s) acknowledges that in case a Participant is top ranked for 2 or more Bumper Prizes during the Campaign Period, only the Bumper Prize with the highest value shall be deemed to have been won by the Participant and the Participant shall be deemed to be disqualified for the purpose of other Bumper Prizes.</p>
                <p>f)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A Participant(s) has to score minimum 60,000 points during whole campaign period to be eligible for winning 1st Bumper Prize.</p>
                <p>g)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A Participant(s) has to score minimum 40,000 points during whole campaign period to be eligible for winning 2nd Bumper Prize.</p>
                <p>h)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A Participant(s) has to score minimum 20,000 points during whole campaign period to be eligible for winning 3rd Bumper Prize.</p>
                <p>i)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A Participant(s) has to score minimum 10,000 points during whole campaign period to be eligible for winning 4th Bumper Prize.</p>

                <p><b>6&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>Prize(s):</u></b></p>
                <p>A&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bumper Prize(s) –</p>
                <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Four (4) Participant(s) shall be selected for below mentioned levels during the entire duration of Campaign Period, as per the Winner Selection Criteria mentioned in clause 5.1 and shall win as per the below table:-</p>

                <div align="center">
                    <table border="1" align="center" style="align-content: center">
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center"><b>Prize Level</b></td>
                            <td align="center"><b>Prize (Paytm Cash*)</b></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">1st Bumper Prize</td>
                            <td align="center">70,000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">2nd Bumper Prize</td>
                            <td align="center">50,000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">3rd Bumper Prize</td>
                            <td align="center">20,000</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td align="center">4th Bumper Prize</td>
                            <td align="center">10,000</td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <p>B&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Daily prize-</p>
                <p>I&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Daily one (1) Participant shall be selected from 1st April 2019 to 31st May 2019 as per the Winner Selection Criteria mentioned in clause 5.1 and shall win Rs.1,000 (Rupees One Thousand Only) Paytm Cash each.</p>
                <p>II&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A Participant has to score minimum 1,000 points daily to be eligible for winning the Daily Prize on that day. </p>
                <p>III&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;A Participant can win the daily prize only once during entire campaign period. </p>
                <p><b>NOTE</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The selection of all the Winner(s) shall take place within 10 Working/Business days of end of Campaign Period & the gratification shall be distributed thereafter. The selection period may change/alter/extend at the sole discretion of Contest Bazaar. </p>

                <p><b>7&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>Winner Selection and Announcement:</u></b></p>
                <p>7.1&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Post selection of Winner(s), the results will be published on mentioned link <a href="http://contestbazaar.mobi/contest/DeclareWinner.aspx" class="a">http://contestbazaar.mobi/contest/winner</a></p>
                <p>7.2&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Contest Bazaar shall also make three (3) attempts within 48 working hours after completion of Campaign Period to contact the Winner on their registered Mobile Number registered for playing the contest to inform about the gratification and further process of claiming the gratification.</p>
                <p>7.3&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The gratification will be forfeited and the Winner agrees to surrender the gratification if:</p>
                <p>a&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Winner does not get contacted within 48 working hours.</p>
                <p>b&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Winner does not claim the gratification and/or fails to submit all necessary documents within 1 working day of being contacted by Contest Bazaar.</p>
                <p>7.4&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;In case of weekends, the Winners will be contacted the next working day(s).</p>
                <p>7.5&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;All decisions by Contest Bazaar regarding the selection of Winner(s) shall be final and binding.</p>
                <p>7.6&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The gratification under this Campaign is neither assignable nor transferable under any circumstance, unless specifically provided hereunder.</p>
                <p>7.7&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The gratification to Winner shall be given subject to compliance with all applicable statutory legislations including RBI guidelines in respect of prepaid payment instrument, processes and formalities (including KYC formalities as may be applicable) in connection with the gratification and on production of all such documents/papers as may be applicable and required by Contest Bazaar.</p>
                <p>7.8&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any failure on Participant(s)/Winner part to comply with directions issued by Contest Bazaar for claiming the gratification shall entitle Contest Bazaar to forfeit the gratification.</p>
                <p>7.9&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Eligibility for claiming the prize: To be eligible to claim the gratification/s under the Campaign, the Winner must have a valid KYC verified account (as per RBI guidelines). If the account is not KYC verified, the Winner must submit documents for KYC and get his/her account KYC verified before claiming the prize.</p>
                <p>7.10&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If the same person plays the challenge from multiple accounts, he /she will be awarded only one gratification and account through which he/she gets themselves registered to play this Campaign, the same account shall be considered and used by Contest Bazaar to gratify the Winner. Further, Winner shall not raise any dispute against the decision of Contest Bazaar in this regard.</p>
                <p>7.11&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;All gratification must be claimed by the Winner(s), along with the documents (if applicable) specified herein below within the 48 hours by the Organizers. The documents required to be submitted along with the claim by the Winner(s) include the following (the document list* is only inclusive and not exhaustive and can change as per the requirements of law):</p>
                <p>a)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Address proof (Voter ID / Driving License / Passport/electricity bill not older than 3 months /Telephone bill not older than 3 months etc.)</p>
                <p>b)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Photo Id proof (Aadhar Card / Passport/Voter ID/Driving License etc. mandatory)</p>
                <p>c)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;One passport size photo (compulsory)</p>
                <p>d)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Postpaid bill (for postpaid user) (additional document)</p>
                <p>e)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PAN card copy self-attested</p>
                <p>f)&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Letter of compliance with rules and regulations and declarations in the format as may be required by the Organizers or applicable laws.</p>
                <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*(the document list is only inclusive and not exhaustive and can change as per the requirements of Law or Organizers). If the Winner fails to comply with the herein set requirements his/her right to win the prize shall be forfeited. Once the Winner's documents have been received and confirmed the result will be published on <a href="http://contestbazaar.mobi/contest/DeclareWinner.aspx" class="a">http://contestbazaar.mobi/contest/winner</a></p>
                <p>7.12&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Post completing documentation process, the Winner will be informed (through tele-calling) regarding the modalities of the prize and distribution thereof. Delivery of prize will be subject to the Winners giving the correct address and his/her availability there. In the event the prize cannot be delivered, when specified that they will be delivered, due to reasons beyond the control of Contest Bazaar, the Winners shall collect them from the nearest place specified by Contest Bazaar.</p>
                <p>7.13&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Contest Bazaar does not make any commitment, express or implied to respond to any feedback, suggestion and/or queries of the Participant(s).</p>
                <p>8&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The gratifications offered in this Campaign will be sponsored and distributed by Contest Bazaar.</p>
                <p>9&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any gratifications to a person/Participant(s) of value in excess of INR 10,000 (INR Ten Thousand Only), will be subject to deduction of taxes. Contest Bazaar shall in advance deduct TDS amount as per applicable Income tax rules. In case the prize is delivered/ given to the Winner, then the Winner shall pay TDS by Demand Draft (DD) equal to the TDS amount in advance in favor of Sanvir Digitech Private Limited. In the event the Participant(s) is not able to pay the TDS amount, Sanvir Digitech Private Limited. will have the right to forfeit the gratification/prize amount with no further liability in this regard.</p>
                <p>10&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Without prejudice to the foregoing Clause, any failure on the part of the Winner(s) under this Campaign to comply with directions issued by Contest Bazaar shall entitle Contest Bazaar, at its own discretion, to cancel and forfeit the gratification for the said Winner(s). The gratification shall be distributed only after and subject to confirmation of an existing Permanent Account Number (“PAN”) of the Winner(s).</p>
                <p>11&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cash vide Cheque/DD will be provided only if the product is unavailable at sole discretion of Contest Bazaar</p>
                <p>12&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Contest Bazaar shall not be responsible for any delay on part of a third party including the courier agency, in delivering the gratification (if applicable). All costs and expenses for collecting the gratification unless otherwise specified shall be borne solely by the Winner(s) under this Campaign and the gratification shall not be transferable and no request shall be entertained by Contest Bazaar for such transfer.</p>
                <p>13&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Without prejudice to the foregoing, under no circumstance shall the Winner(s) of the Campaign be entitled to redeem any category of gratification for cash, unless expressly mentioned herein. Contest Bazaar, at its sole discretion, may or may not provide a cash alternative to any of the gratification being offered in this Campaign.</p>
                <p>14&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;This Campaign is skill based and is being made purely on a “best effort” basis and participation of eligible Participant(s) is voluntary, and subject to the applicable these T&C.</p>
                <p>15&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;By entering the Campaign, You confirm and waive the applicability of rules and regulations of the National Do Not Call Registry and You agree to receive promotional messages and alerts including without limitation daily updates on the score under this Campaign from Contest Bazaar, as they may in their sole and absolute discretion decide.</p>
                <p>16&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Participant(s) may contact Contest Bazaar at <a class="a" href="mailto:customer.care@svmobi.com ">customer.care@svmobi.com </a>regarding any queries/complaints pertaining to the Campaign between 9:30 AM to 6:30 PM, on working days from Monday to Friday. All disputes must be addressed by the Participant(s) in writing to Contest Bazaar. Further, any information that the Participant(s) may request in connection with the Campaign, may be provided by Contest Bazaar to the Participant(s), at the sole and absolute discretion of Contest Bazaar, depending on the nature of the information requested, and any such information may be provided as per Clause 19 of Part-A mentioned herein below. No such request shall be entertained thereafter. Contest Bazaar further clarifies that any information requested by any Participant(s) shall only concern that Participant(s) and under no circumstances will Contest Bazaar provide confidential information or information pertaining to other Participant(s).</p>
                <p>17&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Prizes as depicted in the banner are for illustrative purpose only.</p>
                <p>18&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Participant(s) who are residents of Telangana, Assam, Odisha, Sikkim and Nagaland are not eligible to participate in this Campaign.</p>
                <p>19&nbsp;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;We will entertain queries maximum for the period of one month, from the time the Campaign Period ends. On completion of one month period, we will not be held accountable/answerable for the queries raised by the Participant(s).</p>
